  "guideContent": {
    "strategyOverview": "Four-color poison proliferate engine that uses Atraxa's end-step proliferate trigger to amplify poison counters delivered by infect and toxic creatures. Early turns deploy efficient poison sources like Blighted Agent and Plague Stinger to land initial counters. Mid-game establishes proliferate engines through Tekuthal, Inquiry Dominus and Inexorable Tide to double all proliferate triggers. Late-game closes with Skithiryx for flying infect damage or Vraska's ultimate for 9 poison counters, both accelerated by the proliferate network. Every card either delivers poison or proliferates existing counters, creating inevitability as the game progresses."
  },
